Package: uk.551.chargingratetest
Name: 551UK USB Charge Control
Version: 0.8.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Depends: python3, ldid
Description: Native iOS charging current controller with charger, input rail and battery power readings.
 Persistent adjustable 500–2400mA wired cap, experimental bounded software USB power restart on Restore, independent recovery watchdog and background safety logs.
 No thermal simulation, CPU/GPU throttling, charging pause or rate-index modification.
 Native UIKit Charge Control app; immediate USB cap readback, connection feedback and iOS telemetry-delay disclaimer; legacy USB Diagnostics app removed; only Charge Control app installed. No Safari, URLs, or terminal commands required.
